## NOTES (on delivering large artifacts):
- You do not have access to the caller's local filesystem. Do not claim to write, edit, or verify an output file.
- Return the COMPLETE artifact -- not a summary or progress note -- inside exactly one `<Response>...</Response>` block; the framework materializes that block as the output file.
- Keep the entire deliverable in that single block. If several `<Response>` blocks are emitted, only the last complete one is retained (not concatenated).
- Do not wrap any part of the deliverable in ```json fences; the review pipeline extracts the first ```json fence as a control payload and strips ```json blocks from the artifact.
